I.2- Based on the information in Figure I.1, propose an experimental approach for an NMR-based screening of the ten substances and subsequent characterization of a complex, considering that you have one or two 5 µM samples of unlabeled protein and one sample of 0.5 mM 15N-labeled protein. Describe in particular:
a. The samples that you will prepare from the available samples (specify approximate concentrations of the molecules that you will use in the prepared samples);
b. The NMR experiments that you would perform in a chronological order (eventually specify important details for the data collection);
c. The expected information that you will retrieve from each experiment and eventual limitations.
